OL,3,GNEWSAMen held in major incident near
OL,4,ARAF base as homes evacuated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major incident has been declared and
OL,7,Fhomes have been evacuated in a village
OL,8,Fnear an RAF base which hosts the United
OL,9,FStates Air Force.
OL,11,FGloucestershire Police said residents
OL,12,Fin Whelford, near RAF Fairford, have
OL,13,Fbeen taken to a leisure centre while
OL,14,Finvestigations continue.
OL,16,FSeveral men have been arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of offences under the
OL,18,FExplosives Act, police said.
OL,20,FThe Army's specialist explosive
OL,21,Fordnance disposal team is currently
OL,22,Fexamining a number of vehicles.
